## Messenger & Notifications

Notification delivery is configured in `.agent/messenger.md`. Disabled by default.

### Channels

| Channel | Status | Config |
|---------|--------|--------|
| Terminal | Enabled | Always active |
| Discord | Disabled | Set `DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL` env var |
| Slack | Disabled | Set `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL` env var |
| Telegram | Disabled | Set `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN` + `TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID` env vars |

### Severity Levels

| Level | Events |
|-------|--------|
| high | blocked, crashed, failed |
| normal | task advanced, role assigned |
| low | task queued, dependency waiting |
| info | batch completions, session summaries |

