## Learning From Other Projects

Use `/learn <project_path>` to analyze an external project and extract adoptable patterns:

```
/learn ../reference-project
/learn ../reference-project --quick    # structure + config only
/learn ../reference-project --report   # report only, no adoption prompts
```

Reports are saved to `.agent/reports/learn-{name}-report.md`. Selected patterns can be converted into pipeline tasks via `/task create`.

