## Getting Started

1. Install the team-pipeline plugin in Claude Code
2. Open this project and run `/task-init`
3. Configure `.agent/config.md` with your build/test commands
4. Optionally run `/init-roles` to activate additional roles
5. Optionally run `/init-skills` to detect and install project-relevant skills
6. Start working: `/task create`

